  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SP Caritas - Improve productivity and sustainability tilapia value chain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Caritas Norway - Pharmaq project aims to increase productivity, profitability and sustainability in the tilapia value chain in Colombia. Introduction of better health management and vaccines will improve the quality of the fish, reduce mortality levels and costs for producers, significantly reduce the environmental impact of fish farming, and create higher income and new jobs in a sector in growth.</narrative>
  </description>
